{"id":"n1-068","title":"Noun に言わせれば (Noun ni iwasereba)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses 'according to', 'if you ask', 'in the opinion of'.","longExplanation":"The に言わせれば grammar point is used when we want to express someone's opinion or viewpoint. It can be translated as 'according to', 'if you ask', or 'in the opinion of'. This form is mostly used in formal or written language.","formation":"Noun + に言わせれば","examples":[{"jp":"先生に言わせれば、毎日勉強することが重要だと言う。","romaji":"Sensei ni iwasereba, mainichi benkyou suru koto ga juuyou da to iu.","en":"According to the teacher, it's important to study every day.","words":[{"surface":"先生","vocabId":"1387990","reading":"せんせい"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言わ","vocabId":"1587040","reading":"いう","baseForm":"言う"},{"surface":"せれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"せる"},{"surface":"ば","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"毎日","vocabId":"1524720","reading":"まいにち"},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"重要","vocabId":"1336820","reading":"じゅうよう"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言う","vocabId":"1587040","reading":"いう"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,4]},{"jp":"彼に言わせれば、早く結婚する方がいいと思っている。","romaji":"Kare ni iwasereba, hayaku kekkon suru hou ga ii to omotte iru.","en":"If you ask him, he thinks it's better to get married early.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言わ","vocabId":"1587040","reading":"いう","baseForm":"言う"},{"surface":"せれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"せる"},{"surface":"ば","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"早く","vocabId":"1400150","reading":"はやく","baseForm":"早い"},{"surface":"結婚","vocabId":"1254790","reading":"けっこん"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"方",